    "status": 200,
    "response": "data: {\"type\":\"start\",\"messageId\":\"msg-01a15174-0937-72ec-a841-fa4fe6bab483\"}\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"text-start\",\"id\":\"msg-01a15174-0937-72ec-a841-fa4fe6bab483-t0\"}\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"text-delta\",\"id\":\"msg-01a15174-0937-72ec-a841-fa4fe6bab483-t0\",\"delta\":\"This plan v2 budgets 10,000 BU across 6 pockets and keeps 5% of sales as a tax reserve. Supplier: 5,000 BU, at most 1,250 BU per payment and 2,500 BU per 7 days, paid only through escrow milestones. Packaging: 1,500 BU, at most 375 BU per payment and 750 BU per 7 days. Logistics: 800 BU, at most 200 BU per payment and 400 BU per 7 days. Ads: 1,200 BU, at most 300 BU per payment and 600 BU per 7 days. Ads spend is paced at 75 BU per day. Platform fees: 500 BU, at most 125 BU per payment and 250 BU per 7 days. Contingency: 1,000 BU, at most 250 BU per payment and 500 BU per 7 days. 4,000 BU is released when you sign; the next 6,000 BU needs sales of 2,000 BU by 2026-11-17 and the loan officer's signature. Only registered platform accounts and suppliers you approve can be paid; the plan adds no payees. If the AI agent were fully compromised, the most it could move inside these rules is 4,000 BU.\"}\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"text-end\",\"id\":\"msg-01a15174-0937-72ec-a841-fa4fe6bab483-t0\"}\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"data-intent\",\"id\":\"intent-draft-01a15174-092f-7983-9f4e-9c9ef909c5b9\",\"data\":{\"intent\":{\"intentVersion\":1,\"countryCode\":\"MY\",\"residency\":\"citizen\",\"entityType\":\"sole_prop\",\"productCategory\":\"drinkware_food_contact\",\"sellChannel\":\"shopee\",\"buyFrom\":\"CN\",\"budgetCeilingMinor\":\"1000000\",\"horizonDays\":60,\"lineEmphasis\":{\"SUPPLIER\":\"high\",\"ADS\":\"med\",\"CONTINGENCY\":\"low\"},\"adsPacing\":\"standard\",\"answeredSlots\":[\"residency\",\"productCategory\",\"budgetCeilingMinor\",\"buyFrom\"],\"assumptions\":[{\"slot\":\"entityType\",\"text\":\"Assumed: Sole proprietorship\"}]}}}\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"data-plan-draft\",\"id\":\"draft-01a151